<span id="A2.F4.p1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">- Q: "where does the story the great gatsby take place" | Answers: [’Long Island of 1922’]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.5.3" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
