</span></span></span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.7.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;"></span></span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.8.3" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F4.p1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.F4.p1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">- Q: "when did korn’s follow the leader come out" | Answers: [’August 18, 1998’, ’Summer 1998’]</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.9.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A2.F4.p1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.F4.p1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">  Doc: "Follow the Leader...was released on August 18, 1998"</span>
</span></span></span><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;"><span id="A2.F4.p1.1.10.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
